  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">THREE. is a clean, petroleum-free lip protection brand made with just three powerful ingredients: beeswax, shea butter, and coconut oil.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We help people break the cycle of dry, peeling lips caused by over-processed lip balms and switch to pure, simple, natural protection.<br>Most lip balms rely on petroleum and additives that create short-term relief but long-term dryness.<br>THREE. breaks that cycle with a <strong>pure, simple, natural formula</strong> that supports healthy lips over time.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates earn <strong>20%–35% commission per sale</strong>, depending on performance.<br>You’ll receive:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>A unique affiliate link</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>A personalized discount code</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Monthly payouts via PayPal or bank transfer<br>Top-performing creators are eligible for higher commissions and bonuses.</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We love authentic, short-form content that shows:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Real application and texture</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Daily use (especially in dry or cold conditions)</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Why switching away from petroleum matters</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Preferred platforms: <strong>TikTok &amp; Instagram Reels</strong><br>No medical claims or exaggerated before/afters — honesty wins here.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Approved creators may receive <strong>free product samples</strong>.<br>We repost top content and actively support our affiliates with creative prompts and assets.<br>Posting within <strong>10 days of receiving product</strong> is expected.</span></p></div>",
